      "path": "cover.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "cover.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.main{flex:1;margin:76px 48px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.eyebrow{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7A1C29;font-weight:700}.title{font:700 60px/1.11 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif;max-width:990px;margin-top:29px}.bottom{border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between}.subtitle{font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;max-width:740px}.meta{font-size:15px;color:#5A5F65;text-align:right;line-height:1.55}.footer{margin:28px 48px 38px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><main class=\"main\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">EkklesiaRD · Architecture proposal</div><h1 class=\"title\">Episcopal clergy offices<br>and scoped authorization</h1></div><div class=\"bottom\"><div class=\"subtitle\">Keep ordination, ecclesial office, administrative priority, and digital permission distinct.</div><div class=\"meta\">CODEIGNITER 4 + SHIELD<br>IMPLEMENTATION PLAN · 2026</div></div></main><div class=\"footer\"><span>Basis: ekklesiaRD clergy-ordination-office-authorization-plan.md</span><span>01 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "four_axes.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "four_axes.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:28px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;margin-top:13px;color:#5A5F65}.grid{flex:1;margin:29px 48px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.cell{background:#fff;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding:23px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.tag{font:600 15px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#7A1C29}.cell h2{font:700 26px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif;margin-top:12px}.cell p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.43;margin-top:13px}.cell strong{font-weight:700}.foot{margin:24px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>Four independent axes prevent role inflation.</h1><p>A title describes a person or office; it does not establish digital jurisdiction.</p></div><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"cell\"><div><div class=\"tag\">01 / PERSON</div><h2>Ordained order</h2></div><p>Verified deacon, priest, bishop—or no order. <strong>Canonical fact; no app access by itself.</strong></p></section><section class=\"cell\"><div><div class=\"tag\">02 / APPOINTMENT</div><h2>Ecclesial office</h2></div><p>Rector, ordinary, cathedral dean, regional dean. <strong>One approved, dated scope per office.</strong></p></section><section class=\"cell\"><div><div class=\"tag\">03 / PLATFORM</div><h2>Admin priority</h2></div><p>Shield system 4 · province 3 · diocese 2 · parish 1 · other 0. <strong>Protects account mutations.</strong></p></section><section class=\"cell\"><div><div class=\"tag\">04 / ACTION</div><h2>Digital permission</h2></div><p>Operation + exact entity ID + active office/delegation. <strong>Revocable and auditable.</strong></p></section></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: AdminHierarchyGuard.php; AuthGroups.php; Episcopal Church glossary</span><span>02 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "scope.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "scope.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:28px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:12px}.body{margin:30px 48px 0;flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:580px 1fr;gap:36px}.tree{background:#fff;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding:20px 25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-around}.node{border:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding:12px 17px;font:600 18px Inter,Arial,sans-serif;background:#fff}.node span{float:right;font-size:14px;color:#5A5F65}.level1{margin-left:24px}.level2{margin-left:48px;border-left:4px solid #7A1C29}.level3{margin-left:72px}.arrow{margin-left:48px;height:15px;border-left:1px solid #868E96}.rules{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-around}.item{border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding-top:20px}.item h2{font:700 21px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.item p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:10px}.foot{margin:22px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>Deanery is a scope under one diocese—not a new admin tier.</h1><p>Any configured Episcopal diocese may participate; authority never follows from shared province membership.</p></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"tree\"><div class=\"node\">Province <span>no implied grant</span></div><div class=\"arrow\"></div><div class=\"node level1\">Diocese A <span>one bishop's office</span></div><div class=\"arrow\"></div><div class=\"node level2\">Deanery D <span>explicit membership</span></div><div class=\"arrow\"></div><div class=\"node level3\">Parishes P1 · P2 <span>current members</span></div><div class=\"node level1\">Parish P3 <span>no deanery required</span></div></div><div class=\"rules\"><div class=\"item\"><h2>Contained by identity, not rank</h2><p>A dean's limited coordination reaches only member parishes in Deanery D.</p></div><div class=\"item\"><h2>Membership is time-bounded</h2><p>A moved parish leaves the previous dean's current access. Historical attribution remains intact.</p></div><div class=\"item\"><h2>Diocese B stays separate</h2><p>A bishop, dean, or app admin in Diocese A has no authority in Diocese B without a new grant.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Sources: HierarchyService.php; Diocese of Massachusetts, Deaneries and Regions</span><span>03 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "offices.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "offices.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:27px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:12px}.body{flex:1;margin:27px 48px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.matrix{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;table-layout:fixed}.matrix th{background:#1F2124;color:#fff;font-size:16px;text-align:left;padding:15px 13px}.matrix td{border:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding:15px 13px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.3;vertical-align:top}.matrix tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#F8F9FA}.matrix td:first-child{font-weight:700}.bottom{border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding-top:16px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3}.bottom strong{color:#7A1C29}.foot{margin:19px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>Similar clerical titles have different jurisdictions.</h1><p>Approved office and verified order must both match the requested action.</p></div><div class=\"body\"><table class=\"matrix\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:23%\">Office</th><th style=\"width:16%\">Order</th><th style=\"width:24%\">Scope</th><th style=\"width:37%\">Limited app capability</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Diocesan ordinary</td><td>Bishop</td><td>One diocese</td><td>Diocesan pastoral review and canonical report approval</td></tr><tr><td>Rector / priest-in-charge</td><td>Priest</td><td>One congregation</td><td>Parish pastoral work and clergy report finalization</td></tr><tr><td>Cathedral dean</td><td>Priest</td><td>One cathedral congregation</td><td>Cathedral pastoral work; finalizes only as priest-in-charge</td></tr><tr><td>Regional dean</td><td>Priest by default</td><td>One defined deanery</td><td>Limited regional coordination; no parish CRUD</td></tr><tr><td>Deacon / curate</td><td>Deacon / priest</td><td>Assigned ministry</td><td>Task-specific ministry; no automatic sign-off</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"bottom\"><strong>No office automatically confers finance, app-account management, province, or TEC-wide rights.</strong></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Sources: Episcopal Church Rector / Ordinary / Deacon; Massachusetts deaneries</span><span>04 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "decision.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "decision.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n    .slide-container{\n      width:1280px;\n      height:720px;\n      background:#F8F9FA;\n      color:#1F2124;\n      display:flex;\n      flex-direction:column;\n      font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;\n      padding:28px 48px;\n    }\n    .rule{\n      height:4px;\n      background:#7A1C29;\n      margin-bottom:18px;\n      width:100%;\n      border-radius:2px;\n    }\n    .head{margin:0}\n    .head h1{\n      font:700 28px 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif;\n      line-height:1.05;\n    }\n    .head p{\n      font-size:16px;\n      color:#5A5F65;\n      margin-top:8px;\n    }\n    .body{\n      flex:1;\n      margin-top:16px;\n      background:#fff;\n      border:1px solid #D1D5DB;\n      padding:12px 18px;\n      display:flex;\n      flex-direction:column;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      gap:6px;\n    }\n    .step{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:50px 200px 1fr;\n      align-items:center;\n      border-bottom:1px solid #D1D5DB;\n      min-height:62px;\n      gap:12px;\n      padding:8px 4px;\n    }\n    .step:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n    .no{font:700 18px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#7A1C29}\n    .label{font-weight:700;font-size:17px}\n    .detail{font-size:16px;line-height:1.3;color:#1F2124}\n    .foot{\n      margin-top:12px;\n      padding-top:10px;\n      border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      font-size:12px;\n      color:#5A5F65;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <h1>Authorize the action and its target—not the title alone.</h1>\n      <p>Deny by default when any one of these checks fails.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"no\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">Account</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\">Authenticated, active, approved, and linked to a person.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"no\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">Eligibility</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\">Verified order and current standing for an ordained function.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"no\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">Office</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\">Approved, effective position or explicit dated delegation.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"no\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">Capability</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\">Shield route permission plus a provenance-tracked scoped grant.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"no\">05</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">Target scope</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\">Exact diocese/deanery/parish containment; current membership.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"no\">06</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">User mutations</div>\n        <div class=\"detail\">Additionally apply the existing 4–0 account-hierarchy guard.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <span>Sources: AuthGroups.php; AdminHierarchyGuard.php; plan §3</span>\n      <span>05 / 09</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "current.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "current.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:27px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:11px}.cols{flex:1;margin:28px 48px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px}.col{background:#fff;border-top:3px solid #1F2124;padding:18px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-around}.col h2{font:700 23px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.row{border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding-top:16px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4}.row strong{display:block;font-weight:700}.code{font:500 16px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:5px}.foot{margin:23px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>The code has appointments, but not verified ecclesial authorization.</h1><p>Reuse the existing foundation while closing four privilege and data gaps.</p></div><div class=\"cols\"><div class=\"col\"><h2>Existing foundation</h2><div class=\"row\"><strong>Scoped position records</strong><span class=\"code\">leadership_position</span> records offices, dates, and parish/diocese/province IDs.</div><div class=\"row\"><strong>Shield groups and permissions</strong><span class=\"code\">AuthGroups.php</span> holds administrator levels and group capabilities.</div><div class=\"row\"><strong>Account priority</strong><span class=\"code\">AdminHierarchyGuard.php</span> blocks lower-tier mutations of higher-tier users.</div></div><div class=\"col\"><h2>Required corrections</h2><div class=\"row\"><strong>Submitted order is not proof</strong>Current forms accept clergy category/order without independent verification.</div><div class=\"row\"><strong>Global clergy permissions are broad</strong>Generic clergy grants cover finance views and report finalization.</div><div class=\"row\"><strong>Revocation and report shapes drift</strong>Seeder adds direct grants; report model differs from schema snapshot.</div></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Sources: LeadershipPositionService.php; AuthGroups.php; PermissionRoleSyncSeeder.php</span><span>06 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "schema.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "schema.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:27px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:11px}.grid{flex:1;margin:27px 48px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.entity{background:#fff;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding:21px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.entity:nth-child(4){border-top:4px solid #7A1C29}.entity h2{font:600 19px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace}.entity p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.34}.small{font-size:15px;color:#5A5F65}.foot{margin:22px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>The schema separates verified facts from candidate evidence.</h1><p>Historical records stay intact; only reviewed, active offices may provision scoped access.</p></div><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"entity\"><h2>person</h2><p>Stable identity, optionally linked to a Shield user.</p><div class=\"small\">Existing canonical entity</div></div><div class=\"entity\"><h2>clergy_ordination</h2><p>Order event, date, verification state and verifier.</p><div class=\"small\">Person-linked · no automatic grant</div></div><div class=\"entity\"><h2>canonical_status</h2><p>Diocesan licence, residence or inhibition with dates.</p><div class=\"small\">Separate from order</div></div><div class=\"entity\"><h2>leadership_position</h2><p>Approved office, exact scope and term; add deanery_id.</p><div class=\"small\">Existing table + extension</div></div><div class=\"entity\"><h2>deanery + membership</h2><p>One parent diocese; time-bounded parish grouping.</p><div class=\"small\">Optional per parish</div></div><div class=\"entity\"><h2>review + scoped grants</h2><p>Legacy claims held for review; only later approved grants issue access.</p><div class=\"small\">Candidate ≠ permission</div></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: clergy-deanery-schema-permissions.md, §2</span><span>07 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "permission.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "permission.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:27px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:11px}.body{flex:1;margin:26px 48px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.matrix{width:100%;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff}.matrix th{background:#1F2124;color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:16px;padding:14px 12px}.matrix td{font-size:16px;padding:14px 12px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;line-height:1.29}.matrix tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#F8F9FA}.matrix td:first-child{font-weight:700}.grant{font-weight:700;color:#7A1C29}.note{border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding-top:15px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.34}.foot{margin:18px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>Grant capabilities to scoped offices, not universal clergy labels.</h1><p>“Yes” means approved + current + exact target scope; a dash is never implied.</p></div><div class=\"body\"><table class=\"matrix\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:27%\">Capability</th><th style=\"width:18%\">Ordinary</th><th style=\"width:18%\">Rector / cathedral</th><th style=\"width:18%\">Regional dean</th><th style=\"width:19%\">App admin</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Diocesan report approval</td><td class=\"grant\">Yes · diocese</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Delegate only</td></tr><tr><td>Parish clergy finalization</td><td>—</td><td class=\"grant\">Yes · own parish</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Deanery coordination</td><td>Delegate only</td><td>—</td><td class=\"grant\">Yes · deanery</td><td>Delegate only</td></tr><tr><td>Deanery structure edits</td><td>Delegate only</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Authorized diocese</td></tr><tr><td>Finance / user administration</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Separate app grants</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"note\"><strong>Always check:</strong> Shield permission + provenance-tracked, active scoped grant + verified office/order + target ID.</div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Source: clergy-deanery-schema-permissions.md, §3; AuthGroups.php</span><span>08 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "rollout.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "rollout.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Serif:wght@400;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#F8F9FA;color:#1F2124;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.rule{height:4px;background:#7A1C29;margin:42px 48px 0}.head{margin:27px 48px 0}.head h1{font:700 30px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5A5F65;margin-top:11px}.body{flex:1;margin:25px 48px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.table{background:#fff;border:1px solid #D1D5DB}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 258px 1fr;min-height:76px;border-bottom:1px solid #D1D5DB;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:12px 21px}.row:last-child{border-bottom:0}.num{font:700 20px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#7A1C29}.phase{font:700 20px 'PT Serif',Georgia,serif}.outcome{font-size:18px;line-height:1.32}.callout{border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;padding-top:15px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.37}.callout strong{color:#7A1C29}.foot{margin:19px 48px 35px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #D1D5DB;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#5A5F65}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"head\"><h1>Stage evidence first; turn on authority only after verification.</h1><p>The draft migration is deliberately outside active migration discovery and has not been executed.</p></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"table\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"num\">01</div><div class=\"phase\">Inventory + backup</div><div class=\"outcome\">Audit people, offices, direct grants, report schema and diocesan memberships.</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"num\">02</div><div class=\"phase\">Expand schema</div><div class=\"outcome\">Add ordination evidence, deanery, effective membership and review queue.</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"num\">03</div><div class=\"phase\">Review candidates</div><div class=\"outcome\">Legacy clergy group and position rows remain unverified—not entitlements.</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"num\">04</div><div class=\"phase\">Enforce scope</div><div class=\"outcome\">Roll out per-resource office checks, managed grants and revocation.</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"num\">05</div><div class=\"phase\">Reconcile + test</div><div class=\"outcome\">Narrow blanket permissions; test deanery, diocese and report sign-offs.</div></div></div><div class=\"callout\"><strong>Production gate:</strong> reconcile live MySQL schema, confirm local diocesan signatory policy, rehearse on a clone, then run full tests.</div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Sources: DraftClergyDeaneryTransition.php; clergy-deanery-schema-permissions.md</span><span>09 / 09</span></div></div></body></html>"
